---
import AppLayout from '../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Wind & Hybrid Energy for Textile Mills | Surat & Gujarat | OnLoop Energy" description="Cut electricity bills for textile dyeing and weaving mills in Surat & Gujarat. OnLoop Energy engineers captive wind and hybrid systems for 24/7 textile production.">
<div>

  {/* JSON-LD Schema Markup for Industry Page */}
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "Captive Wind & Hybrid Energy Systems for Textile Mills",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "LocalBusiness",
      "name": "OnLoop Energy",
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "addressLocality": "Ahmedabad",
        "addressRegion": "Gujarat",
        "addressCountry": "IN"
      }
    },
    "areaServed": ["Surat", "Ahmedabad", "Gujarat", "India"],
    "description": "Custom captive wind and hybrid energy systems engineered to lower per-meter electricity costs for textile dyeing, processing, and weaving plants."
  })} />

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section class="hero hero--short">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__content">
        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
          <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
          Textile & Dyeing Industry Solutions
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero__title">
          Lower your per-meter production cost with <span class="hero__title-highlight">24/7 captive wind & hybrid power.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">Engineered specifically for textile dyeing, processing, and weaving units in Surat and across Gujarat facing high grid tariffs and continuous multi-shift operations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The Problem */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: var(--space-12);">
        <div>
          <span class="content-section__label">Industry Challenges</span>
          <h2 class="content-section__title" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">The Textile Energy Dilemma: Night Shifts & Thin Margins</h2>
          <p class="content-section__text">
            Textile dyeing and processing plants operate on tight margins where electricity accounts for up to 20-30% of total processing overhead. Dyeing jets, stenters, jet dyeing machines, and air-jet looms run on 24-hour continuous cycles.
          </p>
          <p class="content-section__text" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            While traditional solar installers push rooftop PV panels, solar only operates from 10am to 4pm. For a Surat textile unit running night shifts, solar covers less than a third of daily power draw. When night shift grid tariffs hit ₹8–10 per unit, profits evaporate.
          </p>
          <p class="content-section__text" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            Furthermore, textile clusters in coastal Gujarat experience strong, consistent wind profiles that remain completely untapped by conventional solar-only systems.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-8); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); background: var(--color-bg-light);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Textile Energy Impact</h3>
          <ul class="feature-list">
            <li class="feature-item" style="border: none; padding: var(--space-2) 0;">
              <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>₹8–10 / unit</strong> peak grid tariff for industrial units</span>
            </li>
            <li class="feature-item" style="border: none; padding: var(--space-2) 0;">
              <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>18+ hours/day</strong> night shift power draw ignored by solar</span>
            </li>
            <li class="feature-item" style="border: none; padding: var(--space-2) 0;">
              <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>25% of operating budget</strong> consumed by electricity bills</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The Solution */}
  <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="content-section__header">
        <span class="content-section__label">The OnLoop Solution</span>
        <h2 class="content-section__title">Wind-First Captive Power for Textile Units</h2>
        <p class="content-section__text">How our compact wind turbines and wind-solar hybrid plants deliver true 24/7 cost reduction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
          <h4 class="card__title">Night Shift Generation</h4>
          <p class="card__text">Our captive wind turbines generate power continuously across evening and night shifts, offsetting expensive utility grid tariffs when your dyeing jets are running.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
          <h4 class="card__title">Compact Footprint</h4>
          <p class="card__text">Textile mills in Surat industrial zones often have constrained land. Our direct-drive wind turbines require minimal ground area while yielding high annual energy output.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
          <h4 class="card__title">Monsoon Resilience</h4>
          <p class="card__text">During the Indian monsoon when solar generation drops by 60-70%, wind speeds reach annual peaks. Wind keeps your factory powered when solar fails.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Real Case Study Section */}
  <section class="content-section fade-in" style="background: #ffffff;">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a2840 0%, #0f3d5c 100%); color: #ffffff; border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: var(--space-10);">
        <div class="grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: var(--space-8);">
          <div>
            <span style="color: var(--color-teal); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 0.85rem;">Surat Textile Case Study</span>
            <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: var(--font-size-3xl); margin-top: var(--space-2); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Textile Dyeing Unit, Surat</h2>
            <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); line-height: 1.7; font-size: var(--font-size-base);">
              <strong>The Problem:</strong> A 50-employee textile dyeing plant in Sachin GIDC, Surat was paying ₹4.2 Lakhs/month in electricity bills. Night shift power cuts ruined dye batch quality and spiked grid demand charges.
            </p>
            <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); line-height: 1.7; font-size: var(--font-size-base); margin-top: var(--space-3);">
              <strong>The Solution:</strong> OnLoop Energy engineered a 50kW direct-drive wind turbine + 20kW rooftop solar hybrid system optimized for their 24-hour load curve.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);">
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--space-4);">
              <div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;">Monthly Savings</span>
                <div style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-teal);">₹1.2 Lakhs</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;">Payback Period</span>
                <div style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-green);">3.2 Years</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;">System Size</span>
                <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">50kW Wind + 20kW Solar</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;">Tax Advantage</span>
                <div style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">60% Year 1 AD</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The 3-Step Process */}
  <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
    <div class="container container--narrow" style="text-align: center;">
      <span class="content-section__label">Simple Onboarding</span>
      <h2 class="content-section__title">3 Steps to Lower Your Meter Rate</h2>
      <div class="grid-3" style="text-align: left; margin-top: var(--space-8);">
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
          <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Send Utility Bill</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Share your recent electricity bill and Surat/Gujarat plant location.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
          <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Free Wind Study</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">We run a high-precision hub-height wind resource assessment at zero cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: var(--space-6);">
          <h4 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Captive Hybrid EPC</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0;">Turnkey build and O&M tailored to reduce your per-meter production cost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CTA Section */}
  <section class="cta-section fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <h2 class="cta-section__title">Run a textile mill in Gujarat? Let's analyze your wind potential.</h2>
        <p class="cta-section__text">Get a free wind resource & tariff savings report for your textile plant — no tenders, no pressure, just technical clarity.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
          Request Textile Wind Feasibility
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</AppLayout>
